FILE: /home/user/sdk-alif/alif/samples/modules/tflite-micro/tflm_ethosu/README.rst
------------------------------------------------------------
     1	.. _tflm_ethosu:
     2	
     3	Arm(R) Ethos(TM)-U TensorFlow Lite Micro Application
     4	#####################################################
     5	
     6	Overview
     7	********
     8	
     9	ML inference application using TensorFlow Lite Micro (TFLM) with Arm Ethos-U NPU acceleration.
    10	Runs keyword spotting CNN model optimized with Vela compiler.
    11	
    12	Supported Boards
    13	****************
    14	
    15	+-------+--------+---------+---------+-------------------------+
    16	| Board | U55    | U85     | APSS    | Notes                   |
    17	+=======+========+=========+=========+=========================+
    18	| B1    | Yes    | No      | No      | U55 only                |
    19	+-------+--------+---------+---------+-------------------------+
    20	| E1C   | Yes    | No      | No      | U55 only                |
    21	+-------+--------+---------+---------+-------------------------+
    22	| E3    | Yes    | No      | No      | U55 only                |
    23	+-------+--------+---------+---------+-------------------------+
    24	| E4    | Yes    | Yes     | No      | Dual NPU                |
    25	+-------+--------+---------+---------+-------------------------+
    26	| E7    | Yes    | No      | Yes     | U55 only                |
    27	+-------+--------+---------+---------+-------------------------+
    28	| E8    | Yes    | Yes     | Yes     | Dual NPU                |
    29	+-------+--------+---------+---------+-------------------------+
    30	
    31	Core Type Restrictions
    32	**********************
    33	
    34	- **HE cores (rtss_he)**: U55 supports 128 MACs only
    35	- **HP cores (rtss_hp)**: U55 supports 256 MACs only
    36	- **APSS cores (apss)**: U85 with 256 MACs only (Cortex-A32)
    37	- **U85**: Always 256 MACs (HE, HP, and APSS cores)
    38	
    39	Building and Running
    40	********************
    41	
    42	All build commands use the ``-S`` flag to apply snippets for NPU configuration.
    43	This sample uses TCM/MRAM/SRAM memory and does not require external OSPI flash.
    44	
    45	Building for Alif B1 DK
    46	------------------------
    47	
    48	**HE Core with U55-128:**
    49	
    50	.. code-block:: console
    51	
    52	   west build -b alif_b1_dk/ab1c1f4m51820hh0/rtss_he \
    53	       -S ethos-u55-enable \
    54	       ../alif/samples/modules/tflite-micro/tflm_ethosu \
    55	       -p always -- \
    56	       -DETHOSU_TARGET_NPU_CONFIG=ethos-u55-128
    57	
    58	Building for Alif E1C DK
    59	-------------------------
    60	
    61	**HE Core with U55-128:**
    62	
    63	.. code-block:: console
    64	
    65	   west build -b alif_e1c_dk/ae1c1f4051920hh/rtss_he \
    66	       -S ethos-u55-enable \
    67	       ../alif/samples/modules/tflite-micro/tflm_ethosu \
    68	       -p always -- \
    69	       -DETHOSU_TARGET_NPU_CONFIG=ethos-u55-128
    70	
    71	Building for Alif E7 DK
    72	-----------------------
    73	
    74	**HP Core with U55-256:**
    75	
    76	.. code-block:: console
    77	
    78	   west build -b alif_e7_dk/ae722f80f55d5xx/rtss_hp \
    79	       -S ethos-u55-enable \
    80	       ../alif/samples/modules/tflite-micro/tflm_ethosu \
    81	       -p always -- \
    82	       -DETHOSU_TARGET_NPU_CONFIG=ethos-u55-256
    83	
    84	**HE Core with U55-128:**
    85	
    86	.. code-block:: console
    87	
    88	   west build -b alif_e7_dk/ae722f80f55d5xx/rtss_he \
    89	       -S ethos-u55-enable \
    90	       ../alif/samples/modules/tflite-micro/tflm_ethosu \
    91	       -p always -- \
    92	       -DETHOSU_TARGET_NPU_CONFIG=ethos-u55-128
    93	
    94	Building for Alif E8 DK
    95	-----------------------
    96	
    97	**HP Core with U55-256:**
    98	
    99	.. code-block:: console
   100	
   101	   west build -b alif_e8_dk/ae822fa0e5597xx0/rtss_hp \
   102	       -S ethos-u55-enable \
   103	       ../alif/samples/modules/tflite-micro/tflm_ethosu \
   104	       -p always -- \
   105	       -DETHOSU_TARGET_NPU_CONFIG=ethos-u55-256
   106	
   107	**HP Core with U85-256:**
   108	
   109	.. code-block:: console
   110	
   111	   west build -b alif_e8_dk/ae822fa0e5597xx0/rtss_hp \
   112	       -S ethos-u85-enable \
   113	       ../alif/samples/modules/tflite-micro/tflm_ethosu \
   114	       -p always -- \
   115	       -DETHOSU_TARGET_NPU_CONFIG=ethos-u85-256
   116	
   117	**HE Core with U55-128:**
   118	
   119	.. code-block:: console
   120	
   121	   west build -b alif_e8_dk/ae822fa0e5597xx0/rtss_he \
   122	       -S ethos-u55-enable \
   123	       ../alif/samples/modules/tflite-micro/tflm_ethosu \
   124	       -p always -- \
   125	       -DETHOSU_TARGET_NPU_CONFIG=ethos-u55-128
   126	
   127	**APSS Core (Cortex-A32) with U85-256:**
   128	
   129	.. code-block:: console
   130	
   131	   west build -b alif_e8_dk/ae822fa0e5597xx0/apss \
   132	       ../alif/samples/modules/tflite-micro/tflm_ethosu \
   133	       -p always \
   134	       -S ethos-u85-apss-enable \
   135	       -- -DETHOSU_TARGET_NPU_CONFIG=ethos-u85-256
   136	
   137	.. note::
   138	
   139	   The ``ethos-u85-apss-enable`` snippet defines the Ethos-U85 NPU node with
   140	   GIC interrupt routing (GIC_SPI 355) and the SRAM1 memory region for the
   141	   non-cacheable tensor arena. Using a snippet is the Zephyr-idiomatic approach
   142	   and is consistent with how ``ethos-u55-enable`` and ``ethos-u85-enable`` work
   143	   for RTSS cores. The tensor arena is placed in SRAM1 to ensure cache coherency
   144	   with the NPU without explicit cache maintenance.
   145	
   146	Building for Alif E8 AK
   147	-----------------------
   148	
   149	**HP Core with U55-256:**
   150	
   151	.. code-block:: console
   152	
   153	   west build -b alif_e8_ak/ae822fa0e5597xx0/rtss_hp \
   154	      -S ethos-u55-enable \
