   172	
   173	   west build -b alif_e8_ak/ae822fa0e5597xx0/rtss_he \
   174	      -S ethos-u55-enable \
   175	      alif/samples/modules/tflite-micro/tflm_ethosu \
   176	      -p always -- \
   177	      -DETHOSU_TARGET_NPU_CONFIG=ethos-u55-128
   178	
   179	**APSS Core (Cortex-A32) with U85-256:**
   180	
   181	.. code-block:: console
   182	
   183	   west build -b alif_e8_ak/ae822fa0e5597xx0/apss \
   184	       ../alif/samples/modules/tflite-micro/tflm_ethosu \
   185	       -p always \
   186	       -S ethos-u85-apss-enable \
   187	       -- -DETHOSU_TARGET_NPU_CONFIG=ethos-u85-256
   188	
   189	
   190	Configuration Options
   191	*********************
   192	
   193	**NPU Configuration:**
   194	
   195	- ``ETHOSU_TARGET_NPU_CONFIG``: ethos-u55-128, ethos-u55-256, or ethos-u85-256
   196	
   197	**Snippets:**
   198	
   199	- ``-S ethos-u55-enable``: Enable U55 NPU on RTSS cores (all boards)
   200	- ``-S ethos-u85-enable``: Enable U85 NPU on RTSS cores (E4/E8 only)
   201	- ``-S ethos-u85-apss-enable``: Enable U85 NPU on APSS (Cortex-A32) core (E8 only)
   202	
   203	Snippets automatically apply the necessary device tree overlays to enable the NPU.
   204	
   205	**Performance Tuning:**
   206	
   207	- ``NUM_INFERENCE_TASKS``: Worker threads (default: 1)
   208	- ``NUM_JOB_TASKS``: Sender tasks (default: 2)
   209	- ``NUM_JOBS_PER_TASK``: Inferences per task (default: 2)
   210	
   211	Flashing
   212	********
   213	
   214	.. code-block:: console
   215	
   216	   west flash

