     1	.. _tflite-micro-alif-inference-sample:
     2	
     3	Keyword Spotting using Generic Inference Runner
     4	###############################################
     5	
     6	Overview
     7	********
     8	
     9	This sample demonstrates how to use a generic inference runner to perform Keyword Spotting (KWS) on Alif devices.
    10	
    11	Requirements
    12	************
    13	
    14	- Alif Ensemble or Balletto Development Kit / Application Kit
    15	
    16	Building and Running
    17	********************
    18	
    19	This sample is located at :zephyr_file:`samples/modules/tflite-micro/alif_inference` in the sdk-alif tree.
    20	
    21	To build the sample, you first need to pull in the optional dependencies by running the following commands:
    22	
    23	.. code-block:: console
    24	
    25	   west config manifest.group-filter -- +optional
    26	   west update
    27	
    28	To build the sample for the **U55** version version on E8-DK:
    29	
    30	.. code-block:: console
    31	
    32	   west build -b alif_e8_dk/ae822fa0e5597xx0/rtss_he -S ethos-u55-enable samples/modules/tflite-micro/alif_inference
    33	   west flash
    34	
    35	To build the sample for the **U55** version on E8-AK:
    36	
    37	.. code-block:: console
    38	
    39	   west build -b alif_e8_ak/ae822fa0e5597xx0/rtss_he -S ethos-u55-enable samples/modules/tflite-micro/alif_inference
    40	   west flash
    41	
    42	To build the sample for the **U85** version on E8-DK:
    43	
    44	.. code-block:: console
    45	
    46	   west build -b alif_e8_dk/ae822fa0e5597xx0/rtss_he samples/modules/tflite-micro/alif_inference -S ethos-u85-enable -- -DETHOSU_TARGET_NPU_CONFIG=ethos-u85-256
    47	   west flash
    48	
    49	To build the sample for the **U85** version on E8-AK:
    50	
    51	.. code-block:: console
    52	
    53	   west build -b alif_e8_ak/ae822fa0e5597xx0/rtss_he samples/modules/tflite-micro/alif_inference -S ethos-u85-enable -- -DETHOSU_TARGET_NPU_CONFIG=ethos-u85-256
    54	   west flash

